<!-- ═══ CONTRÔLE ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="sec sec--cream" id="controle">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec__hd rv">
      <p class="kicker">Contrôle</p>
      <h2 class="display d-lg">Aucune IA n’est fiable<br>à 100&nbsp;%. C’est pour ça<br>qu’il y a <span class="em">trois couches</span>.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="tri">
      <div class="tri__i rv"><svg class="tri__viz" viewBox="0 0 280 74" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="rgba(139,60,247,.4)" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M140 14 118 22v14c0 11 9 19 22 22 13-3 22-11 22-22V22Z" fill="rgba(139,60,247,.12)"/></g><rect class="scan" x="106" y="36" width="68" height="2.4" rx="1.2" fill="rgba(235,106,10,.75)"/><g stroke="rgba(235,106,10,.3)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="4 6"><path d="M16 37h84M180 37h84"/></g></svg><p class="tri__t">01 · AVANT</p>
        <h3>Sécuriser avant de livrer</h3>
        
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-shield"/></svg>Garde-fous entrée et sortie</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-lock"/></svg>Masquage des données personnelles</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-test"/></svg>Tests sur les cas limites</li>
        </ul></div>
      <div class="tri__i rv" style="--d:90ms"><svg class="tri__viz" viewBox="0 0 280 74" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="rgba(139,60,247,.55)"><rect class="lvl" x="104" y="31" width="5" height="12" rx="2.5"/><rect class="lvl" x="118" y="31" width="5" height="12" rx="2.5"/><rect class="lvl" x="132" y="31" width="5" height="12" rx="2.5"/><rect class="lvl" x="146" y="31" width="5" height="12" rx="2.5"/><rect class="lvl" x="160" y="31" width="5" height="12" rx="2.5"/><rect class="lvl" x="174" y="31" width="5" height="12" rx="2.5"/></g><circle cx="46" cy="37" r="9" fill="rgba(235,106,10,.22)" stroke="rgba(235,106,10,.65)" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="234" cy="37" r="9" fill="none" stroke="rgba(139,60,247,.5)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M58 37h38M188 37h34" stroke="rgba(26,26,26,.14)" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg><p class="tri__t">02 · PENDANT</p>
        <h3>Observer et intervenir</h3>
        
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-live"/></svg>Supervision live</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-alert"/></svg>Alertes sur anomalie</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-transfer"/></svg>Escalade avec le contexte</li>
        </ul></div>
      <div class="tri__i rv" style="--d:180ms"><svg class="tri__viz" viewBox="0 0 280 74" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="rgba(26,26,26,.07)"><rect x="96" y="20" width="88" height="7" rx="3.5"/><rect x="96" y="34" width="88" height="7" rx="3.5"/><rect x="96" y="48" width="88" height="7" rx="3.5"/></g><rect class="fill" x="96" y="20" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="rgba(235,106,10,.7)"/><rect x="96" y="34" width="62" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="rgba(139,60,247,.6)"/><rect x="96" y="48" width="40" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="rgba(139,60,247,.35)"/><path d="M200 50l14-16 12 9 16-22" stroke="rgba(31,122,69,.6)" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><p class="tri__t">03 · APRÈS</p>
        <h3>Évaluer chaque appel</h3>
        
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-analytics"/></svg>Scoring hallucination</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-workflow"/></svg>Tests A/B prompts et modèles</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ic-kb"/></svg>Chaque correction renforce l’agent</li>
        </ul></div>
    </div>
    <p class="pull rv">« L’objectif n’est pas le risque zéro — c’est d’avoir le <span>même contrôle</span>
      qu’avec vos agents humains. Ou meilleur. »</p>
  </div>
</section>

